{"id":"622352","name":"平菇素馅水饺","author":"还在吃吃吃","authorId":"10106890","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/622352/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"平菇","amount":"300克"},{"name":"油豆腐","amount":"250克"},{"name":"大葱","amount":"半根"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"300克"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"五香粉","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"耗油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"香油","amount":"数滴"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"克面粉加盐加水合成偏软的面团，盖盖子醒发半小时。","img":"images/622352/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"平菇洗净之后下入锅中烧水焯烫，去除水分和草酸。","img":"images/622352/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"平菇攥干水分切碎。","img":"images/622352/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"油豆腐切片后再切成小碎丁。","img":"images/622352/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"大葱半根用刀竖切成条再切成葱末。","img":"images/622352/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将平菇碎、油豆腐碎和葱末分别装入盘中。","img":"images/622352/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入食盐。","img":"images/622352/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入五香粉。","img":"images/622352/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入生抽。","img":"images/622352/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入耗油。","img":"images/622352/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"淋入热油。","img":"images/622352/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"倒入香油。","img":"images/622352/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/622352/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"下面剂。","img":"images/622352/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"擀皮包上馅料。","img":"images/622352/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"包成自己习惯性的饺子。","img":"images/622352/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"水烧开下入饺子轻轻推动防止粘连。","img":"images/622352/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"浇入一次清水煮沸。","img":"images/622352/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/622352/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}